       CLA     NP1-4                                                        0438
CMPARE ADM     0              A(M) BUILT                                    0439
       SBM     0              B(R) BUILT                                    0440
       TPL     QPLUS+1                                                      0441
       TRA     QNEG                                                         0442
 QPLUS STO     CUE                                                          0443
       CLA     NP1-1          CHANGING CONTENTS OF NP1 LOCATIONS            0444
